{
  "schema_version": "wcp/0.2",
  "level": 2,
  "description": "WCP Level 2 (Attestation correctness and recheck). v0.955.1 conformance requires Level 1 plus all cases here. Cases use the new capabilities/upsert and audit/observe RPCs added at v0.955.1 to mint workers and inspect the audit chain over the wire.",
